  "summary": "13 features across HagiCode-org/hagicode-core, HagiCode-org/web.",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>monitoring:</strong> enhance Agent CLI monitoring and install registry (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/984c305ab998858aa447c6ff3fb218bcb8daa582\"><code>984c305</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>orleans:</strong> enhance grains with improved execution and session handling (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/9f768b647c7d408503f855e9351fc7deb79d8381\"><code>9f768b6</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>sessions:</strong> enhance sessions controller with messaging improvements (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/0257e5d86e8c3896e157ac76b2e103eeb826c153\"><code>0257e5d</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>domain:</strong> add historical message filter service (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/f0989c5d38cdc55cd87dd79ed391a8997d567ac1\"><code>f0989c5</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>git:</strong> enhance Git service with rebase support (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/608b703b11df9ac8f28e6ef662c5a2bb98051eba\"><code>608b703</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ai:</strong> update AI provider configuration and streaming (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/44682170926c2bedb4d279e620030e4474b78698\"><code>4468217</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>skill-gallery:</strong> implement skill gallery service (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/759a5906b6238c728b7a16a65206e99ebdec2810\"><code>759a590</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>hero-avatar:</strong> update plugin catalog with enhanced features (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/7af4c52fa9aa4d814e3e8b562238bd9584921ec3\"><code>7af4c52</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>auth:</strong> add GitHub CLI authentication service (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/bdbe611c00652129ebc635f88ba544f8ee517c85\"><code>bdbe611</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ai:</strong> add DeepAgents provider integration (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/d781b9ecdde8a82fad610927ac00d36f6d4e4887\"><code>d781b9e</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>i18n:</strong> update translations for GitHub and hero features (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/2d9a41cb5b5469ac29b4e824e5acaa2d5b98a6c4\"><code>2d9a41c</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>git:</strong> update rebase to use upstream branch terminology (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/1938784cfea9924237864c525f186dff546c22eb\"><code>1938784</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>hero:</strong> add DeepAgents provider and multiline equipment fields (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/4af54f5db909b9bffff6b5020e23620ec9d3f0ea\"><code>4af54f5</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
